[438.585507, "o", "  \u001b[36m●\u001b[0m \u001b[1mSkill\u001b[0m \u001b[2mopticli\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[441.670498, "o", "  \u001b[36m●\u001b[0m \u001b[1mBash\u001b[0m \u001b[2mcd /demo/Alloy; opticli search \"Alloy Track\" --in strings --limit 200; echo; opticli find --type StandardPage --where \"Name~Partn\u001b[2m…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[445.670498, "o", "  \u001b[36m●\u001b[0m \u001b[1mBash\u001b[0m \u001b[2mcd /demo/Alloy; opticli where-used 1230 --pages; echo; opticli where-used 8 --pages; echo; opticli access 1231; echo; opticli acc\u001b[2m…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[449.670498, "o", "  \u001b[36m●\u001b[0m \u001b[1mBash\u001b[0m \u001b[2mcd /demo/Alloy; opticli get 9 --fields MainContentArea,name; echo; opticli versions 9 --limit 4; echo; opticli get 7 --fields Mai\u001b[2m…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[453.670498, "o", "\r\n  Two live pages promote the Alloy Track whitepaper (`/en/alloy-track/download-whitepaper-alloy-track/`, ref 8):\r\n  \r\n"]
[453.670546, "o", "  - **Alloy Track** (`/en/alloy-track/`) has the Whitepaper page directly in its main content area, shown full width.\r\n  - **Alloy Meet** (`/en/alloy-meet/`) shows the \"Alloy Track whitepaper teaser\" block (1230), which links to the Whitepaper page. Both the teaser and this\r\n    version of the page were published today by `opticli`.\r\n  \r\n"]
[453.67083, "o", "  The Partners section (`/en/partners/` and its only child, Partner training) can be read by any logged-in user (the `Authenticated` role). Administrators\r\n  have full access. Anonymous visitors can't see it. These rights are set on Partners itself, and Partner training inherits them.\r\n  \r\n  Partners also has the simple address `/resellers`.\r\n"]
